    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## ðŸ“… Weekly Optimization Routine\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Run this notebook** (Runtime â†’ Run all) â€” takes 10-30 min\n",
    "2. **Review results**:\n",
    "   - Optuna best params â†’ update config.yaml\n",
    "   - ML model AUC > 0.65? â†’ use for exit timing\n",
